This directory is populated by `task dashboard:build-embed`, which builds
dashboard/ (Vite) and copies its dist/ output here for internal/httpui's
go:embed directive to package into the single binary (P2a-UI-001).

This marker file is the only tracked entry under dist/ — it exists solely
so `//go:embed all:dist` has at least one file to match on a fresh
checkout, before the dashboard build has ever run. httpui.New() checks
for a real index.html + assets/ (not just this marker) and fails closed
with a clear error if the real dashboard build output isn't present —
see internal/httpui/httpui.go.
